// wp_race picker race "Hollins Drive descent" (hollins_descent): Back down the hairpins from the top of Hollins Heights to Mercer.
// Generated from wp_race::catalog by wp_wasm's race_scenario_files_match_the_picker
// (WP_RACE_WRITE_SCENARIOS=1); the browser's race_start builds the same scenario with
// the player's car. Entity "player" sits on the last grid slot, the AI field ahead.
// Run standalone, simcli has no race block or AI driver, so the cars wait on the grid
// for 10 s; crates/wp_race/tests/race_picker.rs races it to the finish with wp_opponent
// AI in every seat and checks the expectation ranges.
